# The creature web-slinging returns needs only to be tapped as the cost is paid (CR 702.188a): one tapped before casting
# began does. Bot1's Ornithopter attacks, and when Bot2 answers with a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, Bot1 web-slings Spider-Sense
# for {U} from Mox Sapphire, returning the tapped, attacking Ornithopter. The Bolt is countered, and the Ornithopter, gone
# from combat (CR 506.4), deals no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Spider-Sense
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Sense.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt; Ability: Web-slinging)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Spider-Sense
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
